            "value": "عصا التحكم في الإعدادات ▸ المسرح متى أردت إعادتها"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Kit": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il Kit"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "العدّة"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Kit: CC0 models by Kenney and Quaternius, real-world size, ready for every Look. Search finds them too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il Kit: modelli CC0 di Kenney e Quaternius, a grandezza reale, pronti per ogni stile. Anche la ricerca li trova."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "العدّة: نماذج CC0 من Kenney وQuaternius بأحجام حقيقية وجاهزة لكل أسلوب. يجدها البحث أيضًا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The look, top left": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo stile, in alto a sinistra"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الأسلوب، أعلى اليسار"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models in the Library's Sets come from Kenney (kenney.nl: Furniture, Food, Nature, City, Car, Space, Survival and ": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I modelli dei Set della Libreria provengono da Kenney (kenney.nl: Furniture, Food, Nature, City, Car, Space, Survival e "
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "النماذج في مجموعات المكتبة من Kenney (kenney.nl: Furniture وFood وNature وCity وCar وSpace وSurvival و"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new words keep the timing of the old ones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le nuove parole mantengono i tempi delle vecchie."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تحتفظ الكلمات الجديدة بتوقيت القديمة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Night Market: about 400 objects, six walking figures, four Blobs, lanterns and a slow dolly, for 20 seconds at full speed. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il Mercato notturno: circa 400 oggetti, sei figure che camminano, quattro Blob, lanterne e un carrello lento, per 20 secondi a piena velocità. "
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "السوق الليلي: نحو 400 عنصر وست شخصيات تمشي وأربعة Blob وفوانيس وحركة دولي بطيئة، لمدة 20 ثانية بأقصى سرعة. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other version is saved as a copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'altra versione è salvata come copia"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حُفظت النسخة الأخرى كنسخة"
          }
        }
      }
    },
