    "White paints, black leaves the paper. Pictures with see-through parts paint where they're solid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il bianco dipinge, il nero lascia la carta. Le immagini con parti trasparenti dipingono dove sono piene."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الأبيض يرسم والأسود يترك الورق. الصور ذات الأجزاء الشفافة ترسم حيث تكون مصمتة."
          }
        }
